    "summary": "Read OPERATE_MODE (141), UNIT_TYPE (142) and OVERALL_STATUS (64) for the unit state, then the individual alarm flags from 256 up. Group settings such as fan speed preference (7) can be written with function code 6.",
    "minimum_registers": [
      {
